0..48 Comment "//! `monoid` extends theories through `include`."
49..52 Comment "//!"
53..130 Comment "//! An include adds its members before the local members. `UnitAndZero` joins"
131..208 Comment "//! `Monoid` and `LeftZero` at `Semigroup`, the pushout over what they share."
209..287 Comment "//! The join has one carrier and one multiplication. The checker completes the"
288..305 Comment "//! joined rules."
306..309 Comment "//!"
310..388 Comment "//! `Endo` models `Monoid` with integer endofunctions. `composed` returns `8`."
389..392 Comment "//!"
